{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"764373592540184616","content":"This is the story of how Johnathan Chapman turned The City (Manhattan) into a solar punk borough.\nAct 1.\nJohnathan, a druid sees the great fire of New York. He, being a wildfire druid is worried about his apprentice who left for the city some time ago.\nAct 2. \nHis investigations lead him to find that his apprentice is dead, and despite learning that his body was found at the scene of the crime, he has been burnt to death by non magical means. The true culprits are a group called New Amsterdam, a group of the oldest families in New York- rich dutch Auctioneers. \nAct 3.\nJohnathan follow the trail through Broadway and wall street where he makes allies with the elves who will someday become the dominate force in Manhattan who also need to drive out the insidious force of New Amsterdam.","created_at":"2020-10-10T06:36:54.936000Z","edited_at":"2020-10-10T06:37:47.993000Z","id":"764375895632642078","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
